_entity.pdbx_description
1 polymer 'Neck linker piece a, head 1 (K324-T328, docked geometry of 8RHB); rigid piece of the walking model'
2 polymer 'Neck linker piece b, head 1 (T328-V331, docked geometry of 8RHB); rigid piece of the walking model'
3 polymer 'Neck linker piece c, head 1 (V331-E334, docked geometry of 8RHB); rigid piece of the walking model'
4 polymer 'Neck linker piece d, head 1 (E334, modelled L335-T336 and a copy of the coil start (human A337 = 3KIN rat 339)); rigid piece of the walking model'
5 polymer 'Neck linker piece a, head 2 (K324-T328, docked geometry of 8RHB); rigid piece of the walking model'
6 polymer 'Neck linker piece b, head 2 (T328-V331, docked geometry of 8RHB); rigid piece of the walking model'
7 polymer 'Neck linker piece c, head 2 (V331-E334, docked geometry of 8RHB); rigid piece of the walking model'
8 polymer 'Neck linker piece d, head 2 (E334, modelled L335-T336 and a copy of the coil start (human A337 = 3KIN rat 339)); rigid piece of the walking model'
9 polymer 'Idealised stalk coiled coil, head 1 (poly-Ala, illustrative)'
10 polymer 'Idealised stalk coiled coil, head 2 (poly-Ala, illustrative)'
